{
  "id": "unique-event-020",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#20 - exploring the Rosen House\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1539,1571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The house is filled with religious\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1571,1606]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "paraphernalia. Pages from holy\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1606,1637]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "books are posted over the doors.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1637,1670]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Quite unusual for a family of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1670,1700]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "alleged devil-worshippers! You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1700,1731]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "step into a bedroom and see a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1731,1761]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "middle-aged couple, Seth and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1761,1790]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Tabitha Rosen, looking at you from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1790,1825]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a large dark mirror. Roll a Save vs.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1825,1862]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L3 Fear or lose 1 Sanity.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1862,1887]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you didn’t go insane, you stagger\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,22,59]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "towards the mirror.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,59,79]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "”Free us. A great evil is coming. We\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,79,116]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "can help you against the  the witch\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,116,152]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "children. But we can do so only if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,152,187]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you break the mirror.”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,187,210]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you want to take the mirror with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,210,246]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you, just add it to your belongings.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,246,283]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "It is large and will count as 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,283,315]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "carried objects.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,315,332]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you want to break the mirror, go\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,332,368]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to #22.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,368,376]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you are cursed and you think you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,376,412]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "can break the curse by bringing\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,412,444]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the mirror to a certain location you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,444,481]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-020:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have visited, go to #23.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,481,506]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    84,
    85
  ]
}
